{"slug":"pronouns-starter-l7","artistFeel":"Creedence Clearwater Revival","beat":"Chill Normal","data":{"title":"Pronouns — Starter · Lesson 7","subject":"pronouns","subjectLabel":"Pronouns","level":"starter","lesson":7,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"Classic Rock","lyrics":"[Spoken Intro]\nVamos al mercado… Let's go to the market!\n\n[Hook]\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nWe can see… Nosotros podemos ver\nYou and me… Tú y yo\nUnder the sun… Bajo el sol\nCome and learn with me.\n\n[Verse]\nWalking through the crowd, so alive,\nI see fruits… Veo frutas,\nColors everywhere… Colores por doquier.\nWe are here… Nosotros estamos aquí,\nYou and us… Tú y nosotros,\nExploring every stall… Explorando cada puesto.\nThey are selling… Ellas están vendiendo,\nFresh tomatoes… Tomates frescos,\nAnd the air smells sweet… Y el aire huele dulce.\n\n[Hook]\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nWe can see… Nosotros podemos ver\nYou and me… Tú y yo\nUnder the sun… Bajo el sol\nCome and learn with me.\n\n[Verse]\nLook over there… Mira allí,\nYou (plural)… Vosotros,\nAre having fun… Os estáis divirtiendo.\nThey (feminine)… Ellas,\nAre laughing loud… Están riendo fuerte.\nUs… Nos,\nAnd you (plural, object)… Y vosotros,\nAre enjoying the day… Están disfrutando el día.\nYou (plural, formal)… Ustedes,","vocab":[{"es":"nosotros","en":"we"},{"es":"vosotros","en":"you (plural, informal)"},{"es":"ellas","en":"they (feminine)"},{"es":"nos","en":"us"},{"es":"os","en":"you (plural, informal, object)"},{"es":"ellas","en":"them (feminine)"},{"es":"ustedes","en":"you (plural, formal)"},{"es":"les","en":"to them/to you (plural)"},{"es":"nosotras","en":"we (feminine)"},{"es":"vosotras","en":"you (plural, informal, feminine)"},{"es":"se","en":"oneself/yourself/themselves"},{"es":"mío","en":"mine"},{"es":"suyo","en":"his/hers/theirs/yours (formal)"},{"es":"conmigo","en":"with me"},{"es":"consigo","en":"with himself/herself/yourself/themselves/yourself (formal)"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.1,"end":4.831,"loss":1.68941